Hi Avery,

Today we're releasing Notion 3.0, and the headline is agents.

Notion Agents
Give an agent a goal ("draft next week's team update from this week's meeting notes and the sprint board") and it reads your pages, works across databases, and leaves a draft for you to review. Every action is logged and reversible.

Also in 3.0:
- Enterprise search across Slack, Google Drive, GitHub, and Notion, with answers that cite the source
- Custom agents you can schedule, so a weekly summary writes itself every Monday
- Notion Mail now supports shared inboxes

Agents are available on Business and Enterprise; Plus workspaces get a 30-day preview starting today. Your workspace admin can turn it on under Settings > Notion AI.

See what agents can do: https://mail.notion.so/l/notion-3-agents

